## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

## Test / profiling output
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.coverage

## The CMake build tree for the native libraries. The binaries it produces are under
## native/bin/, which is committed - see below.
native/build/

## The native binaries, which are committed. The [Bb]in/ rule above would otherwise take them, and
## re-including a file needs its directory re-included first - hence two lines.
!native/bin/
!native/bin/**
